WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.440
- [Instructor] Use Scan
in the OneDrive mobile app

2
00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.450
to quickly capture a
document, white board,

3
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.060
business card, or photo.

4
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.542
Tap Scan.

5
00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.120
(gentle music)

6
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.940
Swipe to choose Whiteboard

7
00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.523
and scan the board.

8
00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.510
The image will be
cleaned up automatically.

9
00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.733
Now you can crop it,

10
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:26.793
add text,

11
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.243
or inking.

12
00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:40.663
Select Filters to adjust
lighting or the scan mode.

13
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.103
When you're ready, select Done.

14
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.113
Give it a name and save
it to your OneDrive.

15
00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:00.730
If it's during or within
five minutes after a meeting,

16
00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:03.883
OneDrive asks to share it
with meeting participants.

17
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.023
Need to scan a document?

18
00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:13.733
Swipe to Document and select Scan.

19
00:01:14.985 --> 00:01:18.083
Tad Add to scan additional pages.

20
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.653
After it's saved, search the
scan for exactly what you want.

21
00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:34.873
Nice!
